<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-E.P.153-4 AT TEA AGAINST NATAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-E.P.153-4 AT TEA AGAINST NATAL.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Province were 153 for four when an early tea was taken due to rain on the opening day of their Supersport series cricket match between against Natal at St George's Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: E.P. 153-4 after 55 overs (Kepler Wessels 61, Louis Koen 43).</p>
